                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "47089b43-866e-3516-97dd-5b01ccecd759",
                        "entry_id": "aa4e95b0-570d-322d-81d5-b3ff9df6a34c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "помещение для общественных собраний, концертов и т. п. на курортах"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0aaa51be-ca38-4cca-bdfe-c77c28d5fd11",
                        "source_entry_id": "aa4e95b0-570d-322d-81d5-b3ff9df6a34c",
                        "source_sense_id": "47089b43-866e-3516-97dd-5b01ccecd759",
                        "target_lang_word": "kursaal",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "kursaal",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5e730e08-4e24-31d3-9280-83a16a975718",
                                        "entry_id": "c076794b-4623-3ae5-88d0-d32289bbbe84",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A public hall or building for the use of visitors at health resorts or spas; a casino"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a6e64d67-dc73-4751-9544-7ca2725f16ef",
                                                "sense_id": "5e730e08-4e24-31d3-9280-83a16a975718",
                                                "text": "It was not the polished serenity of fashionable kursaals, the impassive languor of aristocratic gaming-tables, the self-destruction taken with a light word, of the salles of Baden, of Homburg, of Monaco; it was gambling in all its unreined fever, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f170d67e-e9b6-488c-bf9f-fb6919990034",
                                                "sense_id": "5e730e08-4e24-31d3-9280-83a16a975718",
                                                "text": "Use your eyes, man. Look at the Kursaal, its luxuries, its gardens, its gilding, its attractions, all of them cheap, except the one that pays for all; all these delights, and the rents, and the croupiers, and the servants, and the income and liveries of an unprincipled prince, who would otherwise be a poor but honest gentleman with one bonne, instead of thirty blazing lackeys, all come from the gains of the bank, which are the losses of the players, especially of those that have got a system."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "84818aa6-ad6e-4305-a98b-926273fc49e2",
                                                "sense_id": "5e730e08-4e24-31d3-9280-83a16a975718",
                                                "text": "Having brought it to a close, he took his way to the Kursaal. The great German watering-place is one of the prettiest nooks in Europe, and of a summer evening in the gaming days, five-and-twenty years ago, it was one of the most brilliant scenes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "19d3e5fa-c42c-4bab-be83-24b05487ab39",
                                                "sense_id": "5e730e08-4e24-31d3-9280-83a16a975718",
                                                "text": "Kursaal is a German word for casino, and a cosmopolitan term that became popular in the Belle Epoque."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b26cb1f5-b512-400f-b914-af9671fa0d9e",
                        "source_entry_id": "aa4e95b0-570d-322d-81d5-b3ff9df6a34c",
                        "source_sense_id": "47089b43-866e-3516-97dd-5b01ccecd759",
                        "target_lang_word": "Kursaal",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "111644a9-b990-4a2c-8466-85aff1369792",
                        "source_entry_id": "aa4e95b0-570d-322d-81d5-b3ff9df6a34c",
                        "source_sense_id": "47089b43-866e-3516-97dd-5b01ccecd759",
                        "target_lang_word": "casino",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "casino",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a79967aa-e935-3e3a-b407-8bf3aa1e1ce4",
                                        "entry_id": "c83a8987-f71a-34c7-b848-b47f82955813",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Établissement de jeu, de lecture, de conversation, etc., avec ou sans théâtre, qui se trouve dans les stations balnéaires ou thermales."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1f6709c6-b00b-421a-bd93-eea69bec6d4c",
                                                "sense_id": "a79967aa-e935-3e3a-b407-8bf3aa1e1ce4",
                                                "text": "Cette hypothèse paraît vraisemblable si l’on vient à songer […] qu’avant d’y arriver, les curieux reconnaissent, çà et là, plus d’un casino dont l’intérieur et le décor trahissent les spirituelles débauches de nos aïeux."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "44158887-d417-4883-9443-896d65289530",
                                                "sense_id": "a79967aa-e935-3e3a-b407-8bf3aa1e1ce4",
                                                "text": "Devant l’église, de petits groupes papotants se formèrent et presque tout le monde dévala par une ruelle poussiéreuse étouffée entre une grande prairie et des villas isolées, vers l’un des petits casinos du village, rendez-vous du dimanche matin."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "365097c0-a23e-3618-956e-318cbd7db8f6",
                                        "entry_id": "c83a8987-f71a-34c7-b848-b47f82955813",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Établissement de jeu de hasard."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Aujourd’hui"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b345e3b5-8f9e-493a-ab27-e9791081e2df",
                                                "sense_id": "365097c0-a23e-3618-956e-318cbd7db8f6",
                                                "text": "Les casinos ne sont que de gigantesques pièges, vers lesquels le client riche est rabattu, d’abord par le snobisme, ensuite par la publicité du mercantilisme de l’élégance, et enfin par des agents ou des agentes, subtils et caressants."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b1a8d61a-2817-4f79-b3e5-643a2bfaa821",
                                                "sense_id": "365097c0-a23e-3618-956e-318cbd7db8f6",
                                                "text": "Il n’avais jamais compris pourquoi tous ces gens, dans les casinos, restaient longtemps autour des tables, silencieux, immobiles, avec leurs têtes de morts-vivants."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b59da6f2-e0a7-3690-b8fd-63b0922b1487",
                                        "entry_id": "c83a8987-f71a-34c7-b848-b47f82955813",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Jeu des financiers, qui boursicotent, au lieu de financer l’investissement économique productif."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "pejorative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "668ee9bc-a889-452e-ba49-bdb69a57787c",
                                                "sense_id": "b59da6f2-e0a7-3690-b8fd-63b0922b1487",
                                                "text": "Or, après trois décennies d’hégémonie idéologique néolibérale et de pari sur la main invisible du marché, les retombées délétères du capitalisme de casino et l’effilochage du lien social qu’il entraine semble redonner, […], une nouvelle actualité à ce souci."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
